Migration Plan (Priority Order)
Phase 1 — Core infrastructure (do first, unlocks everything)
Create app/Core/Router.php — class-based, replaces both public/index.php switch and api/index.php switch
Create app/Core/Request.php and app/Core/Response.php
Create app/Controllers/BaseController.php — session auth guard, json(), view()
Update public/index.php to just boot and call the router
Phase 2 — Move Hospitalizacija controller (already 80% done)
Move api/Controllers/HospitalizacijaController.php → app/Controllers/HospitalizacijaController.php
Extend BaseController, remove duplicate session/response code
Register routes in one place (app/routes.php)
Phase 3 — Add remaining controllers (one at a time)
AuthController (login/logout, was PrijavaProvera.php)
PacijentController (was PacijentUnos/Lista/Izmeni.php + Logicki/AkcijaSnimiPacijenta.php)
PrijemController, TretmaniController, IzvestajController
Phase 4 — Clean up Views
Move public/delovi/ into app/Views/ organized by module
Create layout templates (header+footer wrapper)
Phase 5 — Phase out legacy
Remove Logicki/ (logic absorbed into controllers/models)
Rename klase/ → app/Models/ or add PSR-4 autoloading